Z||000011||2xsess||09-09-2001||07:46 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by annieL:<BR><B>  Happily.....5 years.....Elkton MD....$60.00, went to the Poconos for our honeymoon, total cost...around $350.00. Of course we did have to endure the embarresment(sp?)of being asked if we were cousins.It's seems cousins can legally marry in MD.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The poconos, the honeymoon capitol of the northeast. I know, I grew up there.<P>I've been married for a little over 3 years, I won't say where I met my wife. We're happy and now there's a little on on the way. OUr wedding was a huge thing in a giant church on a lake in FL, then a 7 day honeymoon in Jamaica which is where my wife is from.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I wanted to go to Vegas for the wedding and the honeymoon but she won that one. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Take care,<BR>Jeff<P><p>[This message has been edited by 2xsess (edited 09-09-2001).]||||reg||1
