Z||000019||JSocha||09-09-2001||05:49 PM||||3 years now!<P>Threw my wife a big wedding party.  <P>Her first marriage, her ex after they got married, went out with his buddies because he didn't want to be at home with her and plus she didn't have that grand of a wedding.  He treated her like dog p*****<P>Told her, its all about her, its her wedding, "plan it like royalty".<P>Took her on a Carabiean cruise via Holland America.  Best time of our lives, except, her allergies kept acting up.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>When you gets married, its YOUR day.  Its alls abouts yous!  <P>It should only happen once in a life time  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> especially withs the guy you luv, so he should make it very, very special for yah!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Just my $0.02...then again...I've been known to be wrong.<P>And once I thought I was wrong, but I was only mistaken.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||10
